      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPrime residential site in the heart of Dun Laoghaire with full planning permission for a stunning contemporary detached 1 bedroom house laid out over three floors.\n\nRef DLRCC Ref D23A/0484.\nRef ABP31814323. \n\nBright spacious Internal floor area of 85 s.qm, over 3 floor levels.\n\nSet out as high end spacious 1 bedroom unit, with level of flexibility.\n\nGround Floor : kitchen/dining room, accessible WC\n\nFirst Floor: large bedroom with adjacent shower room\n\nSecond Floor: Living room with terrace looking down to coast.\n\nFeatures:\nHigh quality contemporary architectural design, dramatic roof lit staircase.\nSpacious living accommodation. \nSecond floor terrace with views to coast.\n1 secure car parking space and bike parking.\n\nDevelopment Contributions: 13,083.50\n(indexation increase applicable).\n\nLifestyle & Location\nNestled in the very heart of Dun Laoghaire, this site places you beside cafés, boutiques, shopping centres, and the beautiful seafront promenade. For commuters and adventurers alike, the DART station is just a three minute walk away and local bus routes are on the doorstep, offering easy access into Dublin city and beyond.\n\nWithin minutes, you can stroll to Sandycove and Glasthule, renowned for their village atmosphere, excellent dining options, and boutique shops. Those who love the sea will relish proximity to Dun Laoghaire's yacht clubs, the West Pier, and coastal walks to Sandycove and the Forty Foot swimming spot. A wealth of leisure amenities, fitness clubs, parks, and sailing opportunities make this one of South Dublin's most desirable lifestyle locations."
